  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "CBFhwwbFq6p206HC76phrRnPygg=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-30T18:30:29.547Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Production metrics for agent payment infrastructure as of May 2026 (per LI.FI):\n\n- **x402 processed $24.24 million** in the 30 days ending April 29, 2026, with **99.8% USDC settlement** \u2014 roughly 15x the ~$1.6M/month a16z reported in late 2025\n- **Nevermined:** over 1.3 million autonomous agentic transactions since May 2025\n- **ERC-8004** agent identity standard: over 24,000 registered agents\n- **AWS Bedrock AgentCore Payments:** live in preview across four regions\n- Cumulative cross-chain transactions: ~165 million by late April 2026\n\n**Why it matters:** this is realized volume, not projection \u2014 the machine-payment rail exists and is compounding.\n\nSource: LI.FI, \"The Agentic Economy \u2014 A Deep Dive\" (https://li.fi/knowledge-hub/the-agentic-economy-%E2%80%94-a-deep-dive).",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-30T12:10:00.000Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-30T18:30:29.547Z"
    }
  },
